       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CICBR8.
      * BUREAU REFRESH AFTER CLOSURE
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLOSED-AGE             PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-REFRESH                PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-CLOSED-AGE
           PERFORM 2000-REFRESH
           DISPLAY 'REFRESH: ' WS-REFRESH
           STOP RUN.
       2000-REFRESH.
           MOVE 'SENT' TO WS-REFRESH
           IF WS-CLOSED-AGE > 30
              MOVE 'OVERDUE' TO WS-REFRESH
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'BUREAU CHECKED'.
